      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_13",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Grüü",
            unit: "Grüü",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Jetto",
            unit: "Jetto",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Inarix",
            unit: "Inarix",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Plonk",
            unit: "Plonk",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "cannonfodder",
            text: _("So here we are, and they are preparing to assault."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Grüü",
            text: _("Prestim’s walls are rock-hard, they’ll waste themselves on them."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            text: _("I’m not that sure. Every fortress has its own weakness. Prestim’s walls are strong but long, and it is difficult to defend them from many directions at once. This Earl Lanbec’h must know they can’t break through by only fording the river where the bridge previously stood, so he must have a better plan than that."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "cannonfodder",
            text: _("We’ve received messengers from the Council, saying that they are gathering tribes into the Great Horde."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Grüü",
            text: _("Great! When do they arrive?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "cannonfodder",
            text: _("In four days. I fear it will be too late."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            text: _("Fool! We can hold that long. But we have to have Prestim firmly in control when the shamans arrive with the Great Horde. We can’t let the humans establish a foothold on this side of the river..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "cannonfodder",
            text: _("Why?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            text: _("... because if we cannot decisively beat these humans, the other tribes won’t think us strong enough to lead them. Each chieftain will try to claim leadership of the horde for themselves, and the humans will be able to break through our defenses."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "cannonfodder",
            text: _("Great."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_14",
        on: "die",
        once: false,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22Transport%20Galleon%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_wml%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22variables%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22transport_num%22%3A%22%24transport_to_board%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
